00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:59.370
And part of what...

129
00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:04.783
I'm not an athlete,

130
00:06:04.783 --> 00:06:09.310
and as I get older, I try to stay in shape

131
00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.900
and doing a very poor job of it.

132
00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:15.320
And when I meet someone who's like a marathon runner,

133
00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:17.310
and in your case, like,

134
00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.270
I don't even know what you call the things you do,

135
00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.923
like ultra mega,

136
00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:26.500
I quit.

137
00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:29.940
Anytime I have a trainer and they push me too hard

138
00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:32.920
and I start to feel a burn or I feel something,

139
00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:35.777
I go, "I don't feel good right now.

140
00:06:35.777 --> 00:06:37.167
"Like my body doesn't like this.

141
00:06:37.167 --> 00:06:38.650
"I feel like I'm gonna puke right now."

142
00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:39.890
And then I just stop.

143
00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:42.560
So, when I find someone or meet someone

144
00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:45.360
who's capable of running hundreds of miles

145
00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:46.410
and all these things,

146
00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:49.800
there's two things, one side of his inspirational.

147
00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:50.990
Wow. The human body.

148
00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:52.590
And then the other side is,

149
00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:55.000
wow, if this guy is capable of this.

150
00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:58.480
I mean, he's capable of like, he's probably a psychopath.

151
00:06:58.480 --> 00:06:59.720
There's so much of that.

152
00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:01.490
Like I get uncomfortable hearing that

153
00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:03.480
because so much of it is projection.

154
00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.550
And I get this a lot when I go out in the world

155
00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:07.900
and perhaps you can relate to your version of it,

156
00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.367
which is, "Oh, did you just run 20 miles?

157
00:07:10.367 --> 00:07:12.070
"Or you could have run here from your home."

158
00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:15.390
And like, in my mind,

159
00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:18.410
I think if they only knew like the reality of it

160
00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:22.720
or how I think of myself, because the truth is right now,

161
00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:23.570
I'm not doing that.

162
00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:25.580
Like I'm doing podcasts and I'm traveling

163
00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.040
and I'm raising teenagers,

164
00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:29.560
