864
00:39:14.250 --> 00:39:16.787
I'm like, "Why are you guys trying to turn me

865
00:39:16.787 --> 00:39:17.620
"against my dad?

866
00:39:17.620 --> 00:39:18.717
"Like why are you tryna get me to..."

867
00:39:18.717 --> 00:39:21.117
And they're like, "Well, that did something,

868
00:39:21.117 --> 00:39:22.927
"that one day did something to you,

869
00:39:22.927 --> 00:39:24.547
"and it's not about blaming them,

870
00:39:24.547 --> 00:39:27.057
"or it's just addressing it,

871
00:39:27.057 --> 00:39:28.617
"cause this is this wound that's open,

872
00:39:28.617 --> 00:39:31.757
