885
00:40:08.700 --> 00:40:10.740
And I don't think people realize.

886
00:40:10.740 --> 00:40:12.320
There's a competitive piece to it.

887
00:40:12.320 --> 00:40:16.403
Like I want it to be as good as it can be.

888
00:40:17.320 --> 00:40:20.930
I want these experiences to be as helpful to other people

889
00:40:20.930 --> 00:40:23.380
as I can possibly craft them.

890
00:40:23.380 --> 00:40:25.770
And it's that tension between self-will,

891
00:40:25.770 --> 00:40:29.750
