894
00:40:34.010 --> 00:40:35.920
like I have to surrender to it,

895
00:40:35.920 --> 00:40:38.973
and it's actually better the looser that I hold it.

896
00:40:39.831 --> 00:40:42.930
And I'm always waging this war with myself over that,

897
00:40:42.930 --> 00:40:45.330
but there's certainly a workaholism piece.

898
00:40:45.330 --> 00:40:47.720
Can I do more? Who else can I get?

899
00:40:47.720 --> 00:40:49.450
Why is that person getting that person

900
00:40:49.450 --> 00:40:50.800
and why can't I do that?

901
00:40:50.800 --> 00:40:51.633
Or why?

902
00:40:51.633 --> 00:40:53.900
Like I buy into a lot of that.

903
00:40:53.900 --> 00:40:56.110
Like that's a lot of my character defects.

904
00:40:56.110 --> 00:40:58.130
And I can hide behind that.

905
