00:44:22.670 --> 00:44:25.600
I just said, "I'm gonna die doing this here."

987
00:44:25.600 --> 00:44:27.130
Like I'm literally gonna die doing this.

988
00:44:27.130 --> 00:44:29.130
So, I stopped podcasting.

989
00:44:29.130 --> 00:44:29.963
And so...

990
00:44:29.963 --> 00:44:33.038
It was pretty abrupt too, like you just stopped uploading.

