00:44:36.940 --> 00:44:41.940
and the podcasts were so...

993
00:44:47.950 --> 00:44:52.173
The ones that I had played for my friends in the same way,

994
00:44:54.240 --> 00:44:56.020
like I like it when it hurts.

995
00:44:56.020 --> 00:44:58.670
Like I imagine like as someone

996
