And I go, "I'm not doing anything.

1011
00:45:38.327 --> 00:45:40.180
"I'm literally talking, using words."

1012
00:45:40.180 --> 00:45:41.017
And they're like,

1013
00:45:41.017 --> 00:45:44.140
"You're saying stuff that is like so bizarre

1014
00:45:44.140 --> 00:45:46.450
and so offensive and so..."

