1017
00:45:53.300 --> 00:45:56.157
And they're like, "Dave, we fucking love you, man.

1018
00:45:56.157 --> 00:45:57.730
"Like don't do that."

1019
00:45:57.730 --> 00:46:00.520
There's a difference between being a provocateur

1020
00:46:00.520 --> 00:46:03.210
and performing like a public self-immolation,

1021
00:46:03.210 --> 00:46:06.810
like it was like this, on one level,

1022
00:46:06.810 --> 00:46:09.760
like your whole life becomes a performance art.

1023
00:46:09.760 --> 00:46:13.670
Like everything that you're doing is a form of media

1024
00:46:13.670 --> 00:46:16.600
that is an expression of your interior life.

1025
00:46:16.600 --> 00:46:21.140
But unmistakable in that was this sense of you,

1026
00:46:21.140 --> 00:46:23.240
I mean, a cry for help is like the wrong term.

1027
00:46:23.240 --> 00:46:24.530
Like it was more severe than that.

1028
00:46:24.530 --> 00:46:25.637
Like you were...

1029
00:46:26.813 --> 00:46:28.880
I wanted to die.

1030
00:46:28.880 --> 00:46:30.240
It was clear to anybody

1031
00:46:30.240 --> 00:46:35.080
