2282
01:41:16.020 --> 01:41:17.230
Like they might be touched by God,

2283
01:41:17.230 --> 01:41:20.085
but someone made these things,

2284
01:41:20.085 --> 01:41:23.250
like someone drew that portrait of Jesus.

2285
01:41:23.250 --> 01:41:25.330
