2792
02:03:29.340 --> 02:03:31.710
And it was that unconscious like,

2793
02:03:31.710 --> 02:03:34.030
I just can't sit still for one second.

2794
02:03:34.030 --> 02:03:38.160
If I sit still for one second, then there's discomfort.

2795
02:03:38.160 --> 02:03:39.170
It's discomfort.

2796
02:03:39.170 --> 02:03:42.453
So, even sitting with Neil and then doing that talk,

