There's all these analytics and stuff that people go,

2855
02:06:19.570 --> 02:06:21.710
okay, if you get Seth Rogan on your show,

2856
02:06:21.710 --> 02:06:22.670
then you get more views.

2857
02:06:22.670 --> 02:06:25.310
And I'm just trying to...

2858
02:06:27.740 --> 02:06:29.810
