2859
02:06:29.810 --> 02:06:32.140
For me to do a show like that,

2860
02:06:32.140 --> 02:06:36.670
I know that I'm helping people and I'm helping myself,

2861
02:06:36.670 --> 02:06:39.507
but what's the cost of that, right? What is it?

2862
02:06:39.507 --> 02:06:40.480
I don't know. What is the cost of it?

2863
02:06:40.480 --> 02:06:42.670
I mean, my sense in watching it is that

2864
