2865
02:06:47.810 --> 02:06:51.360
it's so creatively unique in its expression

2866
02:06:51.360 --> 02:06:52.820
that it could only be you.

2867
02:06:52.820 --> 02:06:57.600
So, it's definitely this sense of like living in your mind

2868
02:06:57.600 --> 02:07:00.990
or kind of living inside of one of your paintings.

2869
02:07:00.990 --> 02:07:05.390
And it's a reflection of all of this work that you've done.

2870
02:07:05.390 --> 02:07:09.410
Like as somebody who's steeped in recovery and therapy

2871
02:07:09.410 --> 02:07:10.243
and the like,

2872
02:07:10.243 --> 02:07:13.570
like those are conversations that I have,

2873
02:07:13.570 --> 02:07:16.300
