2934
02:09:48.010 --> 02:09:50.150
And it was uncomfortable as hell.

2935
02:09:50.150 --> 02:09:51.827
You're talking about porn.

2936
02:09:51.827 --> 02:09:53.590
The woman's talking about porn,

2937
02:09:53.590 --> 02:09:54.740
and I'm sitting there with my son

2938
02:09:54.740 --> 02:09:57.240
and I know he watches all this stuff.

2939
02:09:57.240 --> 02:09:58.580
He doesn't know that I watch it.

2940
02:09:58.580 --> 02:10:00.710
