2968
02:11:08.030 --> 02:11:10.070
Well, you can't do that.

2969
02:11:10.070 --> 02:11:13.580
All right. So I guess, I thought this was a safe place.

2970
02:11:13.580 --> 02:11:14.933
I thought I could do whatever.

2971
02:11:15.900 --> 02:11:18.550
So, I found that I was having these amazing breakthroughs

2972
02:11:18.550 --> 02:11:19.870
and I was watching people

2973
02:11:19.870 --> 02:11:21.430
who I thought would never have breakthroughs,

2974
02:11:21.430 --> 02:11:23.050
