And they're like, "Dave, there's a dentist office out.

2981
02:11:38.047 --> 02:11:39.570
"Like you can't do that."

2982
02:11:39.570 --> 02:11:43.107
And I go, "Oh, you can't, but I can.

2983
02:11:43.107 --> 02:11:45.277
"I have creative license. I have artistic license.

2984
02:11:45.277 --> 02:11:46.270
"I could..."

2985
02:11:46.270 --> 02:11:50.730
So, I tell everyone, like I'm not a guru.

2986
02:11:50.730 --> 02:11:51.710
I'm not a therapist

2987
02:11:51.710 --> 02:11:56.560
even though I've probably been in rooms with group therapy,

2988
02:11:56.560 --> 02:11:57.660
one-on-one therapy.

2989
02:11:57.660 --> 02:12:00.370
I've been at rehab centers

2990
02:12:00.370 --> 02:12:03.270
