there's something liberating about that?

3619
02:39:35.300 --> 02:39:36.920
Like I can just be.

3620
02:39:36.920 --> 02:39:40.490
But then, there's always...

3621
02:39:44.120 --> 02:39:47.829
Everyone I interviewed on my show was close...

3622
