And that's my workaholism of,

3625
02:40:00.600 --> 02:40:02.830
it took me years for me to have breakthroughs,

3626
02:40:02.830 --> 02:40:05.160
but I'm tryna get a breakthrough within six hours.

3627
02:40:05.160 --> 02:40:08.797
So, I'm like, "Why the fuck does this guy run so much?

3628
02:40:08.797 --> 02:40:09.889
"Why does he..."

3629
02:40:09.889 --> 02:40:13.397
Like if someone put a gun to my head and said,

3630
02:40:13.397 --> 02:40:14.977
"You need to run an ultra marathon,

3631
02:40:14.977 --> 02:40:16.620
"or your entire family is gonna be murdered."

3632
02:40:16.620 --> 02:40:18.510
I'd be like, "Just murder my family right now."

3633
02:40:18.510 --> 02:40:23.510
Like that's the same equivalent of, I can't run a 5k.

3634
02:40:24.590 --> 02:40:26.090
Like my legs start hurting.

3635
02:40:26.090 --> 02:40:28.420
I go, "Okay, I'm gonna stop because this hurts."

3636
02:40:28.420 --> 02:40:31.520
So the best, like you said,

3637
02:40:31.520 --> 02:40:33.410
all the best runners are in recovery

3638
02:40:33.410 --> 02:40:34.450
and they're covered in tattoos.

3639
02:40:34.450 --> 02:40:36.550
It's like, what are you running away from?

3640
02:40:36.550 --> 02:40:38.894
The pain of something,

3641
02:40:38.894 --> 02:40:43.890
the amazing ability to completely disassociate your mind

3642
02:40:43.890 --> 02:40:46.730
from your body so that you can, I mean, like for me,

3643
02:40:46.730 --> 02:40:47.563
when I see that I go,

3644
02:40:47.563 --> 02:40:50.360
that definitely you gotta be in shape and physical,

3645
02:40:50.360 --> 02:40:52.270
but it's more mental than physical.

3646
02:40:52.270 --> 02:40:55.140
It's mental. But just to flip the lens on that,

3647
02:40:55.140 --> 02:40:56.580
the other side of that coin

3648
02:40:56.580 --> 02:40:59.720
is that when you put yourself in that position

3649
02:40:59.720 --> 02:41:02.140
of trying to do something really hard,

3650
02:41:02.140 --> 02:41:04.730
you meet yourself in a very fundamental way.

3651
02:41:04.730 --> 02:41:07.320
Like you can't run away from who you are.

3652
02:41:07.320 --> 02:41:09.450
And your character gets revealed,

3653
02:41:09.450 --> 02:41:12.500
your weaknesses, your proclivities,

3654
02:41:12.500 --> 02:41:14.740
like all of the looping in your mind,

3655
02:41:14.740 --> 02:41:17.293
like you become very present with all of that.

3656
02:41:17.293 --> 02:41:19.044
And I think it creates a greater awareness

3657
02:41:19.044 --> 02:41:21.430
of kind of what you're dealing with.

3658
02:41:21.430 --> 02:41:23.650
So you can deconstruct it and move forward.

3659
02:41:23.650 --> 02:41:26.010
Like that's the positive aspect of that.

3660
02:41:26.010 --> 02:41:29.250
Because I got into this at a very difficult time in my life

3661
02:41:29.250 --> 02:41:31.020
where I was confused about who I was

3662
02:41:31.020 --> 02:41:31.900
and what I wanted to be.

3663
02:41:31.900 --> 02:41:33.190
I'd been sober.

3664
02:41:33.190 --> 02:41:34.230
It's not like I went,

3665
02:41:34.230 --> 02:41:36.160
I got sober and immediately jumped into this.

3666
02:41:36.160 --> 02:41:39.890
Like I'd been sober for 10 years before I got into it,

3667
02:41:39.890 --> 02:41:42.950
but I was reaching another like plateau

3668
02:41:42.950 --> 02:41:46.490
or kind of inflection point in my growth.

3669
02:41:46.490 --> 02:41:48.850
And what I found

3670
02:41:48.850 --> 02:41:52.170
through the process of like really submersing myself

3671
02:41:52.170 --> 02:41:55.577
in that subculture is I learned a lot about who I am.

3672
02:41:55.577 --> 02:41:57.840
And I learned what I needed to look at,

3673
02:41:57.840 --> 02:41:58.780
where I was still,

3674
02:41:58.780 --> 02:42:01.250
like all of these blind spots that I've been hiding from

3675
02:42:01.250 --> 02:42:03.820
suddenly like percolate up to the surface.

3676
02:42:03.820 --> 02:42:05.960
So, those things that you're running away from

3677
02:42:05.960 --> 02:42:07.927
like come up, right?
It's so scary.

3678
02:42:07.927 --> 02:42:09.630
But it's an opportunity.

3679
02:42:09.630 --> 02:42:11.980
And I'm not saying I've overcome all of those things,

3680
02:42:11.980 --> 02:42:14.160
but I definitely have a greater awareness of them.

3681
02:42:14.160 --> 02:42:16.760
And I've been able to kind of overcome some of them.

3682
02:42:18.786 --> 02:42:19.970
Wow. It sounds scary.

3683
02:42:19.970 --> 02:42:22.930
Yeah. So, you explaining that to me...

3684
02:42:22.930 --> 02:42:24.220
So, it's like you telling me,

3685
02:42:24.220 --> 02:42:26.487
