3686
02:42:26.487 --> 02:42:30.163
you need to train for a 50-mile run or something like that.

3687
02:42:35.910 --> 02:42:38.982
50 miles. What's a marathon? 26 miles?

3688
02:42:38.982 --> 02:42:39.815
26.

3689
02:42:41.420 --> 02:42:44.259
Fuck. I've never in my life even cared.

3690
02:42:44.259 --> 02:42:45.503
