3694
02:42:53.863 --> 02:42:57.010
And I'll take six months off, that's a challenge.

3695
02:42:57.010 --> 02:42:58.180
I can't even imagine,

3696
02:42:58.180 --> 02:43:01.930
like when anyone explains me like what they need to do

3697
02:43:01.930 --> 02:43:05.140
to do a marathon, that to me sounds like mental illness.

3698
02:43:05.140 --> 02:43:07.250
I go, that doesn't sound healthy.

3699
02:43:07.250 --> 02:43:10.270
Yeah. But that's you putting a cap

3700
02:43:10.270 --> 02:43:12.360
