Without even considering like,

3719
02:44:02.700 --> 02:44:05.313
well, is that even something that you should do?

3720
02:44:06.320 --> 02:44:10.280
So yeah, I guess my feeling when you asked me

3721
02:44:10.280 --> 02:44:11.969
how I'm feeling right now is,

3722
02:44:11.969 --> 02:44:16.690
I bring so much weight to every interview and podcast

3723
02:44:16.690 --> 02:44:17.740
that I do,

3724
02:44:17.740 --> 02:44:22.740
that I left very, and this is part of my growth,

3725
02:44:25.460 --> 02:44:28.880
disappointed in every single interview I did on my show.

3726
02:44:28.880 --> 02:44:29.713
And it's just like,

3727
02:44:29.713 --> 02:44:32.170
unless I had the level of breakthrough

3728
02:44:32.170 --> 02:44:34.360
that I did for years...

3729
02:44:34.360 --> 02:44:36.130
Right. I mean, you're creating a ridiculous expectation

3730
02:44:36.130 --> 02:44:37.090
