and then sadness and then shame and then Burger King,

3758
02:45:47.500 --> 02:45:50.500
and then shame with overeating, then driving home.

3759
02:45:50.500 --> 02:45:52.620
And then, I'm gonna Google,

3760
02:45:52.620 --> 02:45:55.352
