3772
02:46:13.640 --> 02:46:14.720
Thank you, man.

3773
02:46:14.720 --> 02:46:15.553
Same to you, man.

3774
02:46:15.553 --> 02:46:16.386
I appreciate you.

3775
02:46:16.386 --> 02:46:18.420
