3777
02:46:20.670 --> 02:46:22.085
You're welcome, man.

3778
02:46:22.085 --> 02:46:23.410
Thanks. All right, buddy. Peace.

3779
02:46:23.410 --> 02:46:24.521
Peace.

3780
02:46:24.521 --> 02:46:25.354
Plans.

3781
